### Change password (OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/members/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "luffy",
  "newPassword": "LeoVinci123!",
  "confirmPassword": "LeoVinci123!"
