### Get a member public profile (OK - Existing ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a member public profile (KO - Non-existing ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/9999999

### Get a member public profile (OK - (without Token))
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/2



